{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011rVAmUZhoQqeJmGuQqRxz9","type":"tool_result","content":"3 2\n7629:   * Loop a song (or play once with { loop: false }). song = { bpm: 120, steps: 4, tracks: [\n7634:   * steps = steps per beat (4 = sixteenth notes). Each track loops on its own length within the song's (len: steps, else\n7640:   * E.songs has ready-made loops: title, adventure, dungeon, boss, victory.\n7646:    const C = this._clock(song, !!(o.sync !== undefined ? o.sync : song.sync), o.loop !== undefined ? o.loop : song.loop !== false, this._now(!!(o.sync !== undefined ? o.sync : song.sync)));\n7654:  _clock(song, sync, loop, t) {\n7659:    return { src: song, tracks, steps, bpm, spb: 60 / bpm / steps, len: song.len || Math.max(...tracks.map(tr => tr.tokens.length)), loop, sync, start: t, t0: t, s0: 0, done: -1, next: 0, ended: false, vols: tracks.map(tr => tr.on === false ? 0 : 1), bus: null, anchor: null, drift: 0, big: false };\n7677:    const C = this.song; if (!C) return { t: 0, step: 0, beat: 0, bar: 0, at: 0, loop: 0, bpm: 0, layers: [], playing: false };\n7681:  /** call fn(step) on the update step the music reaches step (counted from its start, on as it loops); the song's\n7799:/** ready-made chiptune loops (original compositions): title, adventure, dungeon, boss, victory. game.audio.music('adventure') */\n12893:const song = { bpm: 120, steps: 4, loop: false, len: 32, tracks: [{ wave: 'drums', notes: 'k . h . s . h .' }] };","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4180323d-f450-4e8c-b0bc-56f3660fbb67","uuid":"dce0280a-09a9-47d6-aab7-34ca7834f823","timestamp":"2026-11-03T01:27:28.282Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"3 2\n7629:   * Loop a song (or play once with { loop: false }). song = { bpm: 120, steps: 4, tracks: [\n7634:   * steps = steps per beat (4 = sixteenth notes). Each track loops on its own length within the song's (len: steps, else\n7640:   * E.songs has ready-made loops: title, adventure, dungeon, boss, victory.\n7646:    const C = this._clock(song, !!(o.sync !== undefined ? o.sync : song.sync), o.loop !== undefined ? o.loop : song.loop !== false, this._now(!!(o.sync !== undefined ? o.sync : song.sync)));\n7654:  _clock(song, sync, loop, t) {\n7659:    return { src: song, tracks, steps, bpm, spb: 60 / bpm / steps, len: song.len || Math.max(...tracks.map(tr => tr.tokens.length)), loop, sync, start: t, t0: t, s0: 0, done: -1, next: 0, ended: false, vols: tracks.map(tr => tr.on === false ? 0 : 1), bus: null, anchor: null, drift: 0, big: false };\n7677:    const C = this.song; if (!C) return { t: 0, step: 0, beat: 0, bar: 0, at: 0, loop: 0, bpm: 0, layers: [], playing: false };\n7681:  /** call fn(step) on the update step the music reaches step (counted from its start, on as it loops); the song's\n7799:/** ready-made chiptune loops (original compositions): title, adventure, dungeon, boss, victory. game.audio.music('adventure') */\n12893:const song = { bpm: 120, steps: 4, loop: false, len: 32, tracks: [{ wave: 'drums', notes: 'k . h . s . h .' }] };","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181325__xe8b2f0/work/MadMenOut-MadMen-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181325/src/10-data.js","hunks":[{"oldStart":146,"oldLines":7,"newStart":146,"newLines":7,"lines":["       bell: { at: [38, 13, 1.57], talk: { lines: ['Mr. Calloway. Sit. The bonsai and I were discussing patience.'], choices: [","         { label: 'What does it say?', lines: [['bell', 'That a thing becomes beautiful by what you cut away. Remember that at three o\\'clock.'], ['narrator', 'You feel strangely calmer.']], fx: { composure: 20, rapport: 1, minutes: 30 } }] },","         idle: ['Patience, Mr. Calloway.', 'The founder of an agency is a man who has stopped working.'] },","-      marcy: { at: [15, 22, 4.71], talk: null, idle: ['Bellweather and Crane, good morning.', 'Your eleven o\\'clock canceled, Mr. Calloway. You don\\'t have an eleven o\\'clock.'] },","+      marcy: { at: [16, 21, 1.57], talk: null, idle: ['Bellweather and Crane, good morning.', 'Your eleven o\\'clock canceled, Mr. Calloway. You don\\'t have an eleven o\\'clock.'] },","       joyce: { at: [16, 13, -1.57], talk: null, idle: ['The coffee\\'s fresh. That\\'s the nicest thing I\\'ll say today.'] },","       peg: { at: [18, 13, -1.57], talk: null, idle: ['Typing, typing, typing.'] }","     },"]},{"oldStart":187,"oldLines":8,"newStart":187,"newLines":8,"lines":["       joyce: { at: [4, 22, 0], talk: { lines: ['My sister flies for Pan Am. Isn\\'t that something?'], choices: [","         { label: 'What does she say about it?', lines: [['joyce', 'She says the trick is to smile like nothing could ever go wrong. Even when the wing is on fire. Especially then.']], fx: { card: 'calm', rapport: 0, minutes: 20 } }] },","         idle: ['The percolator\\'s on its last legs. Like me.'] },","-      marcy: { at: [15, 22, 4.71], talk: null, idle: ['That man by the elevator says he\\'ll wait all day.'] },","-      peg: { at: [18, 13, -1.57], talk: null, idle: ['Buzz, buzz. Everyone\\'s talking about the man in the lobby.'] },","+      marcy: { at: [16, 21, 1.57], talk: null, idle: ['That man by the elevator says he\\'ll wait all day.'] },","+      peg: { at: [18, 21, 3.14], talk: null, idle: ['Buzz, buzz. Everyone\\'s talking about the man in the lobby.'] },","       lenny: { at: [27, 23, 3.14], talk: { lines: ['Walt? Walt Penn! Look at you. A suit like a senator.'], choices: [","         { label: 'Lenny. Not here. Walk with me.', lines: [['lenny', 'I knew you\\'d remember. The farmhouse, the creek, your mother\\'s pie on the sill.'], ['lenny', 'I don\\'t want anything, Walt. I just wanted to see somebody from home make good.'], ['jack', 'Home is a word you have to earn, Lenny.']], fx: { card: 'oldname', minutes: 60, composure: -15, flag: 'metLenny' } },","         { label: 'You have the wrong man.', lines: [['lenny', 'Sure. Sure I do. You take care, Mr. Calloway.'], ['narrator', 'He puts his hat on and goes. Theo watches him leave.']], fx: { composure: -5, minutes: 10, flag: 'deniedLenny' } },"]},{"oldStart":231,"oldLines":8,"newStart":231,"newLines":8,"lines":["         { label: 'Tell me about the barn.', lines: [['bell', 'He slept beside the first engine so nobody would steal it. Every car since has been that engine, polished.']], fx: { card: 'barn', rapport: 1, minutes: 30 } }] },","         idle: ['Old men like to be reminded they were young.'] },","       joyce: { at: [16, 13, -1.57], talk: null, idle: ['Big day. Even the elevator looks nervous.'] },","-      marcy: { at: [15, 22, 4.71], talk: null, idle: ['The Kesslers are early. They\\'re waiting in the car. Both of them, not speaking.'] },","-      peg: { at: [18, 13, -1.57], talk: null, idle: ['My father had a Kessler. Funny.'] }","+      marcy: { at: [16, 21, 1.57], talk: null, idle: ['The Kesslers are early. They\\'re waiting in the car. Both of them, not speaking.'] },","+      peg: { at: [18, 21, 3.14], talk: null, idle: ['My father had a Kessler. Funny.'] }","     },","     overhear: { a: 'peg', b: 'marcy', card: 'father', lines: ['PEG: My dad had a Kessler. He let me steer it once, in the church lot.', 'MARCY: Did you crash it?', 'PEG: Into the minister\\'s hedge. Dad laughed so hard he cried.'] },","     looks: ["]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium__20261102-181325__xe8b2f0/work/MadMenOut-MadMen-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261102-181325/src/10-data.js"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_011rVAmUZhoQqeJmGuQqRxz9","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
