b: ready\",\"   0.36  p1 → hub: ready\",\"   0.36  splash over: the round starts once every game has loaded\",\"   0.43  hub → p1: start in 2935 ms\",\"   0.45  hub → p0: start in 2918 ms\",\"   7.98  hub → p1: time-up\",\"   7.98  hub → p0: time-up\",\"   8.05  p1 → hub: result {\\\"score\\\":0}\",\"   8.06  p0 → hub: result {\\\"score\\\":0}\",\"   8.06  round 1 played: finished — standings [[0,1]]\",\"   8.12  hub → p0: end finished\",\"   8.12  hub → p1: end finished\",\"   8.36  conformance: FAIL\"]}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4180323d-f450-4e8c-b0bc-56f3660fbb67","uuid":"1132c850-feae-4279-b585-cd8dc9bf4094","timestamp":"2026-11-03T01:49:05.920Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"&players=2&auto=1 -> {\"done\":true,\"pass\":false,\"game\":\"game.html\",\"players\":2,\"scenario\":\"standard\",\"checks\":[{\"name\":\"head metas\",\"pass\":true,\"detail\":\"hub:session=1 mode=parallel\"},{\"name\":\"hub:session-players is a range within 1–4\",\"pass\":true,\"detail\":\"hub:session-players=1-4\"},{\"name\":\"hub:session-minutes, when given, is a number\",\"pass\":true,\"detail\":\"hub:session-minutes=6\"},{\"name\":\"every copy says hello\",\"pass\":true,\"detail\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"hello names protocol 1 and the mode\",\"pass\":true,\"detail\":\"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"client\\\":\\\"1.3.0\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"parallel\\\",\\\"seats\\\":[1,4]}\"},{\"name\":\"hello seats cover this player count\",\"pass\":true,\"detail\":\"[1,4]\"},{\"name\":\"ready without a key press (the hub’s card asks the players)\",\"pass\":true,\"detail\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"the round starts when the card ends\",\"pass\":true,\"detail\":\"countdown\"},{\"name\":\"parallel: Math.random is seeded, the same on every copy\",\"pass\":true,\"detail\":\"p0: client 1.3.0 seeded true; p1: client 1.3.0 seeded true\"},{\"name\":\"parallel: no game traffic\",\"pass\":true,\"detail\":\"p0 ↑0 p1 ↑0\"},{\"name\":\"parallel: every copy reports its progress\",\"pass\":false,\"detail\":\"