reenshot(path='/tmp/mmo-shots/pad-05-pause.png'); press(9)\n    print('errors', errs)\n    b.close()\nEOF\ntimeout 300 python3 /tmp/mmo-pad.py","description":"Mock DualSense gamepad browser check","timeout":320000}}}
